Implementation Plan: SIMAUD-LEX Frontend
Modern React TypeScript admin panel for the SIMAUD-LEX Legal Tech platform with JWT authentication, professional design, and full backend integration.

User Review Required
IMPORTANT

Directory Location: The frontend will be created in /home/david/simaud-lex-frontend (separate from the backend at /home/david/simaud-lex-backend).

IMPORTANT

Backend Configuration: The frontend will connect to the backend API at http://localhost:3000. Please confirm if this is correct or provide the actual backend URL.

NOTE

Design Specifications: Using the provided color palette:

Primary: Navy Blue (#1e293b) for sidebar and main buttons
